{"t":"Nimmersatt's Lair","s":"nimmersatt-s-lair-7fe56","k":"quest","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Nimmersatt's Lair</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"time\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Time</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">occurs every 6 months</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0<br/>(0 recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/World%20Quests\">World Quest</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">13.21.14040<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">October 4, 2023</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p class=\"no-results\">This quest has no legend.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>Northwest of <a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin\">Carlin</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32252,31590,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32252, 31590, 7)</a>. The <a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia%20Observer\">Tibia Observer</a> location is <a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Islands\">Ice Islands</a> (<a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin\">Carlin</a>).\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p>Some <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRHJhZ29uX0JyaWRlP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\" title=\"Dragon Bride (page does not exist)\">Dragon Brides</span>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p>A chance to obtain the <a href=\"#/wiki/Bottled%20Dragon%20Breath\">Bottled Dragon Breath</a>, necessary to obtain the <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Slayer%20Outfits\">Dragon Slayer Outfits</a> from <a href=\"#/wiki/A%20Sweaty%20Cyclops\">A Sweaty Cyclops</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-quest-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>Announced on Oct 10, 2023\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<p><br/>\nAt the north of <a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin\">Carlin</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32259,31642,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32259, 31642, 7)</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Rascalio\">Rascalio</a> will bring players to Nimmersatt's Lair when prompted with <span class=\"keyword-highlight\">hi</span>, <span class=\"keyword-highlight\">passage</span>, <span class=\"keyword-highlight\">yes</span>.\n</p><p>The place only has <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRHJhZ29uX0JyaWRlP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\" title=\"Dragon Bride (page does not exist)\">Dragon Brides</span>, which have the visual form of <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragons</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\">Dragon Lords</a>, and <a href=\"#/wiki/Frost%20Dragon\">Frost Dragons</a>, but have none of the lethality. Each of the brides have different abilities though, that they use in area around themselves and can afflict <a href=\"#/wiki/Feared\">fear</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Drunk\">drunkenness</a>, and <a href=\"#/wiki/Rooted\">frozen state</a>.\n</p><p>The goal of the raid is to pick up <a href=\"#/wiki/Snowball\">Snowballs</a> at the north of the dungeon and throw them at the <a href=\"#/wiki/Lava%20Wall\">Lava Wall</a> near the entrance. Each Snowball does some damage to the wall and the raid is finished once it is brought down.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Raid_Messages\">Raid Messages</span></h3>\n<ol><li><b>00:00:00</b>: <span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">The dragon Nimmersatt is distracted! Help to breach its lair! Join the heist at the coast north of Carlin!</span></li>\n<li><b>Every 15 minutes until the wall has been destroyed</b>: <span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">The dragon Nimmersatt is distracted! Help to breach its lair! Join the heist at the coast north of Carlin!</span></li>\n<li><b>When the wall is destroyed</b>: <span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">Nimmersatts lair is opened! The heist has ended!</span></li></ol>\n<p>(The last time stamp time depends on how quickly players bring down the wall)\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>","quests":["dragon-slayer-outfits-quest"]}